# telosnex fork: additive-only test files auto-combine during integration
# merges. Our fix branches each append a regression test for their own bug;
# when two branches both append at the end of the same group (natural anchor),
# `ort` reports a conflict even though the two additions are semantically
# independent. `merge=union` keeps both sides of any overlap, which is the
# correct resolution for additive test changes.
#
# Scope: deliberately narrow to realtime_client's test directory. Source
# files stay on `ort` so real semantic conflicts surface normally.
packages/realtime_client/test/*.dart merge=union
